    <string name="adb_wiz_step1_title">STEP 1 OF 3 • Enable Wireless Debugging</string>
    <string name="adb_wiz_step1_instructions">1. Connect watch and phone to the same Wi-Fi.\n2. On watch: Settings → About watch → Software info → tap \'Software version\' 7 times to enable Developer options.\n3. Open Developer options → turn on \'Wireless debugging\'.\n4. Tap \'Pair new device\' (PIN &amp; port).</string>
    <string name="adb_wiz_step1_instructions_installed">1. Connect watch and phone to the same Wi-Fi.\n2. Tap \'Open Wireless Debugging on Watch\' below.\n3. On your watch, tap \'Pair new device\' (the 6-digit PIN &amp; port will fill automatically).</string>
    <string name="adb_wiz_step1_next">Next step: Pair with PIN ›</string>
    <string name="adb_wiz_step1_skip">Already paired on watch? Go to Connect ›</string>
    <string name="adb_wiz_step2_title">STEP 2 OF 3 • Pair with 6-Digit PIN</string>
    <string name="adb_wiz_step2_instructions">Open \'Pair new device\' on your watch. Accessibility automatically fills the IP, Pairing Port, and 6-digit PIN.</string>
    <string name="adb_wiz_step2_back">‹ Back to Step 1</string>
    <string name="adb_wiz_step3_title">STEP 3 OF 3 • Connect ADB Session</string>
    <string name="adb_wiz_step3_instructions">Exit the pairing screen on your watch so Wireless Debugging stays open. The ADB port updates automatically.</string>
    <string name="adb_wiz_paired_badge">✓ Watch Paired</string>
    <string name="adb_wiz_connected_badge">✓ ADB Session Active</string>
    <string name="adb_step1_title">Step 1: Pair Watch (6-Digit PIN)</string>
    <string name="adb_step1_instructions">1. Connect watch and phone to the same Wi-Fi.\n2. Tap \'Open Wireless Debugging on Watch\' and select \'Pair new device\' on your watch.</string>
    <string name="adb_step1_skip_already_paired">Already paired on watch? Go to Connect ›</string>
    <string name="adb_step2_title">Step 2: Connect ADB Session</string>
    <string name="adb_step2_instructions">Ensure Wireless Debugging is ON on your watch, then enter the ADB Port shown on the watch.</string>
    <string name="adb_instructions">1. Connect watch and phone to the same Wi-Fi.\n2. On watch, open Developer options › Wireless debugging.</string>
